  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given series is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the general term is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the sum of <math><mn>11</mn></math> terms of the series is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>11</mn></munderover><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p>Using the formulae for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1012</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>946</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
